<Folder><name>✈️ Flyplasser / knutepunkt</name>
<Placemark><name>1 · Bangkok Suvarnabhumi (BKK)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Fra Bangkok sentrum:</b> 45 min (Airport Rail Link/taxi)<br/>Norse direkte fra Oslo, ~11 t<br/><i>Kilde: direktefly-og-nattransport.md</i><br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=13.6900,100.7500">Åpne i Google Maps</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#s_fly</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>100.7500,13.6900,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
